   "name": "Expertise",
   "type": "Class Feature",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You gain Expertise (see “Rules Glossary”) in two of your skill proficiencies of your choice. Performance and Persuasion are recommended if you have proficiency in them.</p>\n<p>At Bard level 9, you gain Expertise in two more of your skill proficiencies of your choice.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "expertise",
     "count": 2
    },
    {
     "kind": "expertise",
     "level": 9,
     "count": 2
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "class": "Bard",
    "level": 2
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_CLASS_FEATURE_BARD_JACK_OF_ALL_TRADES",
   "name": "Jack of All Trades",
   "type": "Class Feature",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You can add half your Proficiency Bonus (round down) to any ability check you make that uses a skill proficiency you lack and that doesn’t otherwise use your Proficiency Bonus.</p>\n<p>For example, if you make a Strength (Athletics) check and lack Athletics proficiency, you can add half your Proficiency Bonus to the check.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "skill_bonus_unproficient",
     "value": "proficiency:half",
     "rounding": "down",
     "applies_to": "ability checks using a skill without proficiency"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "class": "Bard",
    "level": 2
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_CLASS_FEATURE_BARD_BARD_SUBCLASS",
   "name": "Bard Subclass",
   "type": "Class Feature",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You gain a Bard subclass of your choice. The College of Lore subclass is detailed after this class’s description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Bard levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass’s features that are of your Bard level or lower.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "select",
     "type": "Archetype",
     "name": "Bard College",
     "supports": "Bard Subclass"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "class": "Bard",
    "level": 3
   }
  },
  {
