  {
   "id": "ID_2024_CLASS_FEATURE_BARD_WORDS_OF_CREATION",
   "name": "Words of Creation",
   "type": "Class Feature",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You have mastered two of the Words of Creation: the words of life and death. You therefore always have the Power Word Heal and Power Word Kill spells prepared. When you cast either spell, you can target a second creature with it if that creature is within 10 feet of the first target.</p>",
